{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "name": "Atoma Pay Merchant API (Sign-in & Onboarding Step 1)",
    "description": "Mobile contract for localhost:8090 (dev profile).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import this collection + `Atoma-Merchant-Mobile-Local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select environment **Atoma Merchant - Local (8090)**\n3. Run `./gradlew bootRun` (dev profile, OTP expose + bypass `000000`)\n\n**Suggested flow**\n1. (Optional) Admin Login → Create Category → copy `categoryId` to env\n2. OTP Request → Resend (wait 60s or set resend cooldown 0) → Verify (saves tokens)\n3. Onboarding Config → Application → Patch Business → Submit Business\n4. Refresh / Logout\n\nHeaders `X-Device-Id`, `X-Platform`, `X-App-Version` are set on folder defaults.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('idempotencyKey')) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('idempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth - OTP",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. OTP Request (SMS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.requestId) pm.environment.set('requestId', j.requestId);",
                  "    if (j.devCode) pm.environment.set('otpCode', j.devCode);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "en" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"channel\": \"SMS\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1b. OTP Request (EMAIL)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.requestId) pm.environment.set('requestId', j.requestId);",
                  "    if (j.devCode) pm.environment.set('otpCode', j.devCode);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"channel\": \"EMAIL\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. OTP Resend",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.requestId) pm.environment.set('requestId', j.requestId);",
                  "    if (j.devCode) pm.environment.set('otpCode', j.devCode);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestId\": \"{{requestId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/resend"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. OTP Verify",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.tokens) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refreshToken', j.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestId\": \"{{requestId}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otpCode}}\",\n  \"device\": {\n    \"model\": \"Postman\",\n    \"osVersion\": \"14\",\n    \"pushToken\": \"optional-fcm-token\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.accessToken);",
                  "    if (j.refreshToken) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', j.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Onboarding - Step 1 (Business)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6. Onboarding Config",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const etag = pm.response.headers.get('ETag');",
                  "if (etag) pm.environment.set('configEtag', etag);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.categories && j.categories.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('categoryId', j.categories[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "en" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6b. Onboarding Config (If-None-Match)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "If-None-Match", "value": "{{configEtag}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Load Application",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.version !== undefined) pm.environment.set('applicationVersion', String(j.version));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/application"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Patch Business (draft)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.version !== undefined) pm.environment.set('applicationVersion', String(j.version));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"version\": {{applicationVersion}},\n  \"businessType\": \"REGISTERED_SHOP\",\n  \"businessName\": \"Herat Saffron House\",\n  \"primaryCategoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/application/business"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Submit Business (Continue)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('idempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (j.application && j.application.version !== undefined) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('applicationVersion', String(j.application.version));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}" },
              { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-device-1" },
              { "key": "X-Platform", "value": "android" },
              { "key": "X-App-Version", "value": "0.1.0" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"version\": {{applicationVersion}},\n  \"businessType\": \"REGISTERED_SHOP\",\n  \"businessName\": \"Herat Saffron House\",\n  \"primaryCategoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/application/business/submit"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Setup (dev admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('adminAccessToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Category",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('categoryId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Food & grocery\",\n  \"description\": \"Food and grocery\",\n  \"parentId\": null,\n  \"sortOrder\": 1,\n  \"commissionRate\": 5.00\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Legacy OTP (optional)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "OTP Send (legacy)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"channel\": \"PHONE\",\n  \"identifier\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/send"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP Verify (legacy)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{otpCode}}\",\n  \"channel\": \"PHONE\",\n  \"identifier\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
